# P0.1 benchmark: deterministically regenerable dataset output.
#
# benchmark/data/*.json (~490 MB across 12 files) are synthesized from a fixed
# seed by benchmark/dataset_generator.dart. The generator is the source of
# truth, NOT these bytes — they are reproducible on demand and should never be
# committed. Regenerate with:
#
#   dart run benchmark/dataset_generator.dart
#
# Keep the generator, the harnesses (bench.dart, bench_test.dart,
# integration_test.dart), the docs, and results/ in git. Data stays local.
# NOTE: this .gitignore lives in benchmark/, so patterns are relative to it.
data/
